Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Description: Context-aware radial action wheel, Control Center, and conversion suite for X11
 Radivine ("Branch into action.") is a fast, extensible, context-aware
 hierarchical radial action wheel and desktop utility suite for Linux Mint
 Cinnamon and Ubuntu-based X11 desktops.
 .
 Press Shift while dragging files from Nemo (or invoke via CLI, keyboard
 shortcut, or the Nemo "Open in Radivine" context menu action) to summon a
 radial wheel directly under the cursor in either the default Branching
 (Child Wheels) layout or the optional Concentric (Nested Rings) layout.
 .
 Includes a built-in PNG, JPEG, and WebP image conversion suite with one-gesture
 Quick Convert from the radial wheel, an Advanced Convert desktop window, a
 durable on-demand background worker (radivine-worker) with crash-safe atomic
 file output, a graphical Control Center (radivine-control) with Wheel Layout,
 live Jobs, and Conversion Settings management, and a read-only file preview
 application (radivine-viewer).
